@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentJson = application/json

### Positive: GET /api/debug/panic — recovered 500 (non-production only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/panic
Accept: {{contentJson}}

### Positive: GET /health — still healthy after panic
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentJson}}

### Positive: OPTIONS /health — CORS preflight (allowed origin)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/health
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type

### Negative: GET /health — CORS origin not allowed (no ACAO when CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS is not *)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentJson}}
Origin: https://evil.example
